./crates/core/flags/defs.rs:529:\fBNUL\fP byte or not. By default (without this flag set), once a \fBNUL\fP
./crates/core/flags/defs.rs:530:byte is seen, ripgrep will stop searching the file. Usually, \fBNUL\fP bytes
